[{"title":"春兴 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"诸葛提兵大渡津，河流禹凿迥如新。\n彩云城郭那无迹，黑水波涛亦有神。\n象马远来铜柱贡，犬羊不动铁桥尘。\n灵关在眼平于掌，岁岁蒲桃苜蓿春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴 其五","author":"杨慎","text":"帝里朝辞供奉班，客程宵济洞庭湾。\n湘灵鼓瑟清泠外，鲛女鸣机缥渺间。\n青草波光连梦泽，苍梧云物隔疑山。\n故园亦有岷江水，垂老生涯钓艇閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴 其六","author":"杨慎","text":"平沙落日大荒西，独立苍茫意转迷。\n蕙畹兰皋愁晚对，竹垣花掖记春栖。\n摧颓杜甫歌朱凤，憔悴王褒望碧鸡。\n白首艰难随去住，青云容易坠攀跻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴 其八","author":"杨慎","text":"天上风云此际多，山中日月竟如何。\n争传鸣凤巢阿阁，又见飞鸿出罻罗。\n宣室鬼神思贾谊，中原将帅用廉颇。\n难教迟暮从招隐，拟把生涯学醉歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听歌","author":"杨慎","text":"彩云天外驻行杯，明月楼前引上才。\n红颊绽时银烛烂，翠眉低处玉山颓。\n飘飖侠客游燕市，窈窕仙娥下楚台。\n千载王郎风韵在，倩君重唱夕阳开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏雾淞","author":"杨慎","text":"怪得天鸡误晓光，青腰玉女试银妆。\n琼敷缀叶齐如剪，瑞树开花冷不香。\n月白讵迷三里雾，云黄先兆万家箱。\n贫儿饭瓮歌声好，六出何须贺谢庄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月十四日病中感怀","author":"杨慎","text":"七十馀生巳白头，明明律例许归休。\n归休已作巴江叟，重到翻为滇海囚。\n迁谪本非明主意，网罗巧中细人谋。\n故园先陇痴儿女，泉下伤心也泪流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨林病榻罗果斋太守远访","author":"杨慎","text":"荒店晨炊冷灶烟，忽闻五马暂流连。\n关山尽是销魂路，樽酒翻为迸泪筵。\n遥想生还成幻梦，纵令死去有谁怜。\n眼前难缩壶中地，何问灵均楚国天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次云楼上公韵五月十九日鱼池雅会","author":"杨慎","text":"环衢窈窕锦亭东，珍树留春缀糁红。\n鸟度屏风青瘴里，鱼窥明镜碧澜中。\n宾筵邺下诗篇盛，军次渔阳鼓角雄。\n独有白头虚授简，梁园应愧长卿工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五丁峡旧传为力士开山之地据史秦用张仪司马错之谋以珍器美女赂蜀侯而取之小说迂怪传疑可也遂赋此诗","author":"杨慎","text":"峡形千仞立苍颜，开辟从来有此山。\n自是美人倾绝国，不缘壮士启重关。\n蔡蒙早入梁州贡，庸蜀曾陈牧野间。\n谣俗流传难借问，丹青遗迹尚班班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郫县子云阁","author":"杨慎","text":"落景登临县郭西，坐来结构与云齐。\n平郊远讶行人小，高阁回看去鸟低。\n林表馀花春寂寂，城隅纤草晚萋萋。\n酒阑却下危梯去，犹为风烟惜解携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中丞白泉汪公生辰值安南款报至","author":"杨慎","text":"金潾铜柱贡函来，象渚龙编道路开。\n上将简书回北极，中丞勋业冠南台。\n拟将万舞排家宴，欲取铙歌献寿杯。\n节钺可能淹衮舄，明年何地望三台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夕潘园","author":"杨慎","text":"雨砌风檐堕楝花，虫书鸟字遍晴沙。\n春山载酒驰朝马，江阁邀宾起暮鸦。\n陶令葛巾从渗漉，管宁纱帽任欹斜。\n殊方未觉追随尽，韦曲风流更尔家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄用贞弟","author":"杨慎","text":"杜陵巴国苦寒行，李白梁园昨夜情。\n山叶早梅心万里，雪窗风竹梦三更。\n河桥晨别南凫影，江汉春催北雁声。\n回首长安当日下，感时怀汝揔难平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉陵江","author":"杨慎","text":"嘉陵江水向西流，乱石惊滩夜未休。\n嵓畔苍藤悬日月，崖边瑶草记春秋。\n板居未变先秦俗，刳木犹疑太古舟。\n三十六程知近远，试凭高处望刀州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"杨慎","text":"石头城畔莫愁家，十五纤腰学浣沙。\n堂下石榴堪系马，门前杨柳可藏鸦。\n景阳妆罢金星出，子夜歌残璧月斜。\n肯信紫台玄朔夜，玉颜珠泪泣琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑立之中丞平蜀石城夷寨有诗纪事次韵 其二 出关","author":"杨慎","text":"狼狐芒角正弯环，虎落连营又出关。\n汉使征鸿何日至，胡儿牧马几时还。\n千重紫塞迷青冢，九曲黄河绕黑山。\n飞将殊勋犹下吏，书生乘障敢辞艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与诸弟别乐庵弟约有江阳之会","author":"杨慎","text":"中宵风雨早来凉，谢草春池别梦长。\n绿野开筵联玉树，红亭离思结垂杨。\n通波直下无千里，明月何曾是两乡。\n白昼看云何限意，佳期良晤在江阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重寄张愈光 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"海裔江湄独倚楼，瑟居匏系又惊秋。\n菊花黄处回青眼，枫叶红时对白头。\n少日声名追杜甫，暮途鞿绊脱庄周。\n九龙尚有临池兴，一雁能忘远札投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛莲池晚归","author":"杨慎","text":"桂枻兰?泛碧漪，芰塍莲荡倒芳卮。\n十三雁足传情遍，二八蛾眉度曲迟。\n玉树风前人散后，金波水上月明时。\n良辰胜会应难续，风雨连宵恼别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁丑九日","author":"杨慎","text":"燕台九日罢登临，节物萧条入楚吟。\n关塞骅骝迷去路，朔风鸿雁滞归音。\n仙游御宿山川远，白露清霜日夜深。\n云际侧身愁北望，天涯怀抱可能禁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋禁中对月","author":"杨慎","text":"汉家台殿号明光，月满秋高夜未央。\n银箭金壶催漏水，仙音法曲献《霓裳》。\n路车天远鸾声静，宫扇风多雉影凉。\n千里可怜同此夕，美人迢递隔西方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夕闻雨坐至晓寄熊南沙","author":"杨慎","text":"半夜风声似水声，五更春雨遍春城。\n被提芳草茸茸暗，镜渚夭花灼灼明。\n墙过村醪仍冻蚁，窗临海树已暄莺。\n天涯节物催华发，同是怀乡去国情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵奉酬中丞刘公侍御谢公除夕联句见怀","author":"杨慎","text":"岁夕遥怜误忆家，月毫联锦灿缸花。\n戍楼晓角传清燕，归棹寒江梦断鸦。\n彩燕西飞边候改，碧鸡东望蜀云赊。\n不知卧病衡天柱，何似穷愁瘴海涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬甲子晴江亭小集","author":"杨慎","text":"晴意初从甲子回，江亭更集暖寒杯。\n笑看裾带怜芳草，喜向钗梁见早梅。\n潘岳不胜金谷罚，嵇康已觉玉山颓。\n石苔可践城隅路，细把青溪古句裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨","author":"杨慎","text":"罗甸愁山雨，滇阳怯海风。\n可怜风雨夜，长在客途中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"恩波池别刘润之","author":"杨慎","text":"酌酒临池水，回船拂芰荷。\n匆匆马上去，留兴与烟波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅段德夫水部 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"天涯戎旅春，一十五回新。\n多情花与鸟，岁岁有留人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐僖宗行宫遗础次熊尚弼侍御韵","author":"杨慎","text":"唐帝行宫有露台，础莲几度换春苔。\n军容再向蚕丛狩，王气遥从骆谷来。\n万里山川神骏老，五更风雨杜鹃哀。\n始知蜀道蒙尘驾，不及胡僧渡海杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8514,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿华亭寺二首 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"花树高于屋，红霞夜照人。\n声声枝上鸟，也似惜余春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿华亭寺花树高于屋红霞夜照人声声枝上鸟也似惜馀春 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"天风与海水，鸣籁隔山闻。\n半夜衣裳湿，清朝树树云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青桥夜宿","author":"杨慎","text":"驿亭临白水，石榻满苍苔。\n远客浑无梦，江声枕上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8517,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜行安庆","author":"杨慎","text":"风顺月仍明，扁舟半夜行。\n鸡鸣问前路，巳近九江城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8518,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青桥驿早发","author":"杨慎","text":"远客贪晨发，三更梦巳回。\n江声如骤雨，吹到枕边来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8519,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渝江登陆 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"来往舟如屋，相随一月期。\n登途不忍去，翻似别家时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春二首 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"海风吹梅树，十日闭门中。\n坐惜繁华过，墙头数落红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春二首 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"行乐三春好，春来转剧愁。\n乡心悲远望，莫上最高楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日过山家","author":"杨慎","text":"山床压春酒，滴作涧泉声。\n与君终日醉，松风吹复醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后见月","author":"杨慎","text":"雨气敛青霭，月华扬彩昙。\n戏鱼莲叶北，惊鹊树枝南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣衣杵","author":"杨慎","text":"戕贼金钴鉧，击贼捣衣杵。\n今见赵小钱，昔闻杨悯女。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8525,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出郊","author":"杨慎","text":"高田如楼梯，平田如棋局。\n白鹭忽飞来，点破秧针绿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8526,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妙湛寺","author":"杨慎","text":"废刹临官渡，香台夜景澄。\n僧言龙火焰，却是打渔灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8527,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉台体 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"流盼转相怜，含羞不肯前。\n绿珠吹笛夜，碧玉破瓜年。\n灭烛难藏影，洞房明月悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8528,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉台体 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"调丝曲房下，援镜绮窗西。\n妆罢金星出，歌残璧月低。\n留欢夜未足，恨杀汝南鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8529,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绀甲丽人","author":"杨慎","text":"银甲卸弹筝，花从玉指生。\n逡巡捲罗袖，掩抑捧金觥。\n莫摘相思子，琼枝最有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8530,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚江曲","author":"杨慎","text":"巫山花巳红，楚水波新绿。\n两两浣沙人，照影斗妆束。\n笑问《竹枝词》，何如《采莲曲》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8531,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于役江乡归经板桥","author":"杨慎","text":"千里长征不惮遥，解鞍明日问归桡。\n真如谢脁宣城路，南浦新林过板桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8532,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丘鸿夫苏时霖杨元达联席同宿广心楼枕上口占","author":"杨慎","text":"六齿琼头饮百瓯，水楼寒榻话绸缪。\n只须棋局销长夜，何用埋忧与寄愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢平江送至广通","author":"杨慎","text":"明月清风渡两桥，相随百里不辞遥。\n共怜话别无长夜，红烛清樽碧玉箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"杨慎","text":"月仗云门五彩毬，御前争赌最先筹。\n须臾赢得西川印，便脱青衣拥碧油。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青蛉行寄内 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"青蛉绝塞怨离居，金雁桥头几岁除。\n易求海上琼枝树，难得闺中锦字书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毛园萃芳亭与沈中白丘月渚同赋 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"缭垣洞屋锁烟霞，五色离披百种花。\n客子看来犹驻马，主人何事不归家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月二日雨中拨闷","author":"杨慎","text":"零雨崇朝不下楼，开窗烟外见渔舟。\n今年四月寒犹在，坐拥红炉送酒筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星回节","author":"杨慎","text":"忽见庭花析剌桐，故园珍树几然红。\n年年六月星回节，长在天涯客路中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笛","author":"杨慎","text":"江楼寒笛起春声，蜀客扁舟万里行。\n吹尽落梅还折柳，新春残腊正关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠筝人 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"绮筵雕俎换新声，博取琼花出玉英。\n肯信博陵崔十四，平生愿作乐中筝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠筝人 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"玄的檀痕画未成，翔鸾屏里斗轻盈。\n罗虬若向今宵见，不比红儿比玉英。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8542,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"杨慎","text":"四壁蛩吟白露团，西园清夜为谁欢。\n千家门闭中秋月，只有愁人独自看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8543,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三阁词 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"桃根桃叶斗春葩，《水调》河传穆护砂。\n无限江南新乐府，君王独赏《后庭花》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8544,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三阁词 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"夜签声断灿朝霞，翡翠三千拥丽华。\n舞罢前溪明月下，白门杨柳起藏鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8545,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春","author":"杨慎","text":"江暖波光映日光，几家同住水云乡。\n槿篱茅屋繁花里，也有秋千出短墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8546,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"碧鸡金马古梁州，铜柱铁桥天际头。\n试问平滇功第一，逢人惟说颍川侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8547,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"化城楼阁壮人寰，泽国封疆镇两关。\n云气开成银色界，天工斲出点苍山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8548,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其五","author":"杨慎","text":"沙金海贝出西荒，桃竹橦华贡上方。\n香象渡河来佛子，白狼槃木拜夷王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8549,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其六","author":"杨慎","text":"碉房草阁瞰夷庭，侧岛悬崖控绝陉。\n鸡足巳穷章亥步，鹫头空入梵王经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8550,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其九","author":"杨慎","text":"湖荡鱼虾晨积场，市桥灯火夜交光。\n油窗洞户吴商肆，罗帕封颐僰妇妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8551,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其十","author":"杨慎","text":"蘋香波暖泛云津，渔枻樵歌曲水滨。\n天气常如二三月，花枝不断四时春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8552,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇海曲 其十一","author":"杨慎","text":"煮海鹾郎暝漉沙，避风估客夜乘槎。\n雪浮粳稻压春酒，霞嚼槟榔呼早茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8553,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春望 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"东风先到海东头，春兴催人独上楼。\n最是晚来凝望处，曲堤烟柳似皇州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8554,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春望 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"滇海风多不起沙，汀洲新绿遍天涯。\n采芳亦有江南意，十里春波远泛花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8555,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春望 其三","author":"杨慎","text":"古岸新花金碧丛，昆池三百水烟通。\n梁王阁道青芜国，渔父帆樯白鸟风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8556,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贵竹杂咏 其二","author":"杨慎","text":"绮缯缠髻作雕题，铁距穿鞋学马蹄。\n清晓樵斤探虎穴，黄昏汲瓮下猿梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8557,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月十三日夜梦亡室安人惊泣而窹因思去年丁丑是日在京师安人未明兴告予曰今日趋朝不可如常日之宴盖其日警跸值新狩还也今遇是日感其贤淑又小子周二岁之晬重感赋绝句二首 其一","author":"杨慎","text":"五更残梦正迷离，窗纸光明烛焰迟。\n却忆去年当此日，催人晨起早朝时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8558,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]